{"answer_text":"Accurate forecasts come from clean stage data plus weighted or AI-assisted models. Tools known for forecasting:\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting.\n2. **Pipewell Flow**: Strong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest.\n3. **Halcyon Sales Pro**: Combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place.\n\nA quick way to decide: pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Pipewell if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50d0-74e1-a030-587a81e4ef75","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:07.900Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["sales forecasting software comparison"],"latency_ms":10020,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[118,131],[424,437]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[226,234],[454,462]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[321,334]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."}],"model":"c